From: BearddOddity <beardedoddity@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:06:12 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 04/13] Mod API: retarget; pins module; waypoint time at pace,
 dim behind walls, looks; trail looks and door routing; keys gated on the HUD

dfo.retarget lets a module ask the game to mark another place (the compass, waypoint and trail follow it). A new pins module drops
pins at the crosshair and cycles quest and pins. The waypoint says the time at the player's pace, dims behind a wall and has five
looks; the trail has five looks and, where the street host hands over its doors, leads to the door nearest a mark shut in a
building. Every module key works only while the HUD is up and without Ctrl/Alt/Meta; a test reads the game's default bindings
and fails on a clash.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
